      "borderWidth": 3,
      "borderDash": "solid",
      "note": "\"Gardeners must water only on assigned days and must not use sprinklers, but may hand-water seedlings any day. Violators lose watering privileges for a week.\" Four agreements are packed into this one sentence. Split them apart and each one can be seen, argued about, and changed by itself.",
